@Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5111

### 经熔断器调用下游（连续失败 3 次跳闸，Open 期间返回 503 + 熔断器状态）
GET {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/call
Accept: application/json

### 查看熔断器状态（state / consecutiveFailures / rejectedCalls 等）
GET {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/breaker
Accept: application/json

### 手动重置熔断器为 Closed
POST {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/breaker/reset
Accept: application/json

### 直连下游（默认 ForceFail = true，返回 503）
GET {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/downstream
Accept: application/json

### 配置下游：关闭强制失败（等 Open 10 秒到期后半开探测恢复）
POST {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/downstream/config
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "forceFail": false
}

###
GET {{Demo.CircuitBreaker.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
